{"id": "310", "question": "avg cost to install a second floor in a house", "gt": "Hiring a remodeling contractor to build a second floor addition can cost between $100-$300 a square foot for a typical addition, but the cost can go as high as $400-$500 per square foot depending on the complexity, quality of materials and local labor rates. Building a second floor can cost at least 20 percent more than building the same square footage at ground level.", "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nBased on the information given in the question, we do not have specific details such as the size of the house, the materials used, or the location, which are all factors that can influence the cost of installing a second floor. Therefore, we are unable to provide an accurate average cost without additional information.\nThe given question is asking about the average cost to install a second floor in a house. However, the provided passage does not contain any specific details about the cost of installing a second floor. It only mentions that a second floor could potentially be added to a house, but it does not provide any information about the cost or any other details related to the installation process.\nThere is no specific information given about the cost to install a second floor in a house in the given passage.\n\nUnable to answer based on given passages.", "time_sec": 44.055, "generation_time_seconds": 33.4023, "selection_time_seconds": 10.6529, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"phase": "rollout", "beam": 0, "token_ids": [28715, 389, 279, 1995, 2661, 304, 279, 3405, 11, 582, 653, 537, 614, 3151, 3565, 1741, 438, 279, 1379, 315, 279, 3753, 11, 279, 7236, 1483, 11, 476, 279, 3728, 11, 892, 525, 678, 9363, 429, 646, 10173, 279, 2783, 315, 26632, 264, 2086, 6422, 13,