{"id": "367", "question": "what is the difference between a rock and a stone", "gt": "Based on the given passages, a rock is defined as the hard material of the earth's crust that is normally exposed on the surface or underlying the soil. On the other hand, a stone is described as a smaller piece or pebble that can be carried in the hand. The passages also mention that rocks are made of smaller stones and stones are made from rocks. Additionally, stones can be pelted easily, while rocks cannot. Therefore, the main difference between a rock and a stone is their size, with rocks being larger and stones being smaller and easier to handle.", "pred": "Rocks are generally composed of various minerals, while stones are typically solidified sediments or igneous rocks. Rocks can range from soft to hard, while stones are usually harder and more compact. Rocks are often used in construction, while stones are used for decorative purposes and construction as well.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "Answer: Rocks are generally composed of various minerals, while stones are typically solidified sediments or igneous rocks. Rocks can range from soft to hard, while stones are usually harder and more compact. Rocks are often used in construction, while stones are used for decorative purposes and construction as well.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nI will compare the definitions and characteristics of rock and stone, focusing on their physical properties.\nTo compare the definitions and characteristics of rock and stone, I will analyze their composition, hardness, and use cases.\nBoth rock and stone are naturally occurring, solid materials. However, they differ in their composition, hardness, and use cases. Rocks are generally composed of various minerals, while stones are typically solidified sediments or igneous rocks. Rocks can range from soft to hard, while stones are usually harder and more compact. Rocks are often used in construction, while stones are used for decorative purposes and construction as well.\n\nAnswer: Rocks are generally composed of various minerals, while stones are typically solidified sediments or igneous rocks. Rocks can range from soft to hard, while stones are usually harder and more compact. Rocks are often used in construction, while stones are used for decorative purposes and construction as well.", "time_sec": 43.074, "generation_time_seconds": 28.8283, "selection_time_seconds": 14.2458, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"phase": "rollout", "beam": 0, "token_ids": [5338, 11, 279, 46769, 1265, 387, 24109, 311, 1477, 894, 3151, 17473, 476, 86159, 1865, 1948, 23035, 323, 26210, 13, 1416, 902, 1741, 86159, 525, 1730, 11, 279, 3405, 4157, 387, 18577, 3118, 389, 279, 2661, 46769, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-4.2633, -0.0204, -4.0317, -1.9062, -0.3848, -0.1365, -2.1543, -0.2231, -1.3486, -0.4888, -2.188, -0.1571, -0.0149, -0.7537, -1.7488, -0.0101, -0.736, -0.0, -0.0, -0.0167, -1.1263, -0.9465, -1.1137, -0.5373, -0.0006, -2.1423, -0.0599, -0.3474, -1.4014, -0.1499, -0.0, -0.008, -0.3238, -0.0396, -0.0007, -0.076, -2.7533, -0.0333, -0.0147], "cumulative_logprob": -31.6577, "norm_logp": -0.8117, "input_len": 142, "output_tokens": 39}, {"phase": "rollout", "beam": 0, "token_ids": [28301, 1437, 279, 17452, 429, 6979, 264, 6946, 323, 1846, 429, 6979, 264, 9798, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-1.9419, -0.0023, -0.1077, -2.5872, -1.9856, -0.1045, -0.0291, -0.0008, -0.0951, -1.249, -0.0013, -0.0022, -0.0002, -0.0, -0.2077, -0.0315], "cumulative_logprob": -8.3461, "norm_logp": -0.5216, "input_len": 142, "output_tokens": 16}, {"phase": "rollout", "beam": 0, "token_ids": [3838, 525, 279, 17473, 315, 264, 6946, 323, 264, 9798, 304, 279, 2661, 46769, 30, 151645], "logp_list": [-5.1562, -0.5161, -0.0123, -2.0058, -0.1253, -0.4871, -0.0007, -0.0003, -0.0002, -0.0, -2.7274, -0.1132, -0.6376, -0.0563, -0.0095, -0.0006], "cumulative_logprob": -11.8486