{"id": "435", "question": "how to find someone in france", "gt": "To find someone in France, you can use a website for people search in France. Sending an email or letter to the Town Hall in the person's city of birth can also be helpful, especially if you have lost relatives or friends. Try to find out the person's middle name, it could make the search easier. You can also use the French white pages, available in English at www.pagesjaunes.fr. Enter the person's last name in the 'Nom' field and first name in the 'Prenom' field, enter address information if known, and then click 'Trouver' to search. For searching in Paris and its suburbs, instead of typing Paris in the City field, write IDF (or Ile de France) in the Dept district or region field. Posting a missed connection on Paris Craigslist might also be helpful.", "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nLook for specific information in the passage about methods for finding someone in France.\nUnable to answer based on given passages.\nLook for any mention of resources, tools, or techniques that could be used to find someone in France.\n\nUnable to answer based on given passages.", "time_sec": 38.505, "generation_time_seconds": 26.0098, "selection_time_seconds": 12.4952, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"phase": "rollout", "beam": 0, "token_ids": [28301, 1437, 279, 3151, 2266, 476, 6534, 1380, 9271, 4325, 304, 9625, 374, 2567, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-1.51, -0.0056, -0.1713, -0.4889, -1.9361, -0.0582, -0.6312, -1.4846, -0.3144, -0.0031, -0.0048, -0.0, -0.0555, -1.6262, -0.1251, -0.0857], "cumulative_logprob": -8.5007, "norm_logp": -0.5313, "input_len": 138, "output_tokens": 16}, {"phase": "rollout", "beam": 0, "token_ids": [22043, 279, 3405, 330, 5158, 311, 1477, 4325, 304, 47587, 1335, 432, 374, 19