{"id": "467", "question": "benefits of hiking as a hobby facts", "gt": "Hiking as a hobby has numerous benefits for both the body and the mind. It is an inexpensive and accessible activity that can be enjoyed by individuals of all fitness levels. Hiking allows people to explore and discover beautiful natural areas, promoting a deeper connection with the environment. It also has positive effects on mental health, reducing stress and anxiety. Additionally, hiking is a cardiovascular activity that can improve overall fitness and reduce the risk of heart disease. Exposure to sunshine during hiking can also increase vitamin D levels in the body. Overall, hiking offers a wide range of benefits for individuals seeking physical and mental well-being.", "pred": "Hiking as a hobby offers numerous benefits to both physical and mental health. Physically, it enhances cardiovascular health, strengthens muscles, and improves overall fitness. Mentally, it reduces stress, improves mood, and can even boost cognitive function.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "Answer: Hiking as a hobby offers numerous benefits to both physical and mental health. Physically, it enhances cardiovascular health, strengthens muscles, and improves overall fitness. Mentally, it reduces stress, improves mood, and can even boost cognitive function.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe reasoning steps thus far have focused on analyzing the physical details of hiking, leading to the identification of the primary activity. The next logical step is to consider how these physical activities might contribute to overall well-being, which is a key aspect of the question about the benefits of hiking as a hobby.\nThe current step involves identifying the physical and mental health benefits derived from hiking as a hobby. The logical next step is to delve deeper into these benefits, possibly discussing specific health aspects such as cardiovascular health, muscle strength, and stress reduction.\nThe next logical step is to examine how hiking can contribute to mental health, such as reducing stress and improving mood.\n\nAnswer: Hiking as a hobby offers numerous benefits to both physical and mental health. Physically, it enhances cardiovascular health, strengthens muscles, and improves overall fitness. Mentally, it reduces stress, improves mood, and can even boost cognitive function.", "time_sec": 52.486, "generation_time_seconds": 32.206, "selection_time_seconds": 20.2802, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"phase": "rollout", "beam": 0, "token_ids": [28301, 1437, 279, 3151, 7567, 315, 37364, 438, 264, 31528, 9733, 304, 279, 46769, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-1.218, -0.0028, -0.2499, -0.3399, -0.12, -0.1674, -0.0, -0.8415, -0.2398, -0.0, -0.2416, -0.0012, -0.0, -0.2803, -0.0494, -0.0401], "cumulative_logprob": -3.7919, "norm_logp": -0.237, "input_len": 139, "output_tokens": 16}, {"phase": "rollout", "beam": 0, "token_ids": [641, 6005, 60621, 279, 1995, 911, 279, 3151, 7567, 9733, 304, 279, 21085, 911, 37364, 438, 264, 31528, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-5.8162, -0.807, -0.0019, -0.6826, -1.9637, -0.6207, -0.1575, -2.5223, -0.4144, -2.7715, -0.0223, -0.0005, -0.4666, -2.694, -0.0319, -0.3613, -0.0001, -0.0, -0.1276, -0.0196], "cumulative_logprob": -19.4817, "norm_logp": -0.9741, "input_len": 139, "output_tokens": 20}, {"phase": "rollout", "beam": 0, "token_ids": [785, 32711, 7354, 8450, 3041, 614, 10735, 389, 41018, 279, 6961, 3565, 315, 37364, 11, 6388, 311, 279, 21892, 315, 279, 6028, 5702, 13, 576, 1790, 19819, 3019, 374, 311, 2908, 1246, 1493, 6961, 7488, 2578, 16792, 311, 8084, 1632, 32751, 11, 892, 374, 264, 1376, 12893, 315, 279, 3405, 911, 279, 7567, 315, 37364, 438, 264, 31528, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-2.2001, -1.4198, -0.0491, -6.5946, -0.0004, -0.2921, -0.4477, -0.0013, -0.522, -0.1216, -0.0235, -0.0952, -0.2541, -0.5424, -2.1269, -7.0819, -0.1178, -0.3363, -1.2332, -0.0036, -1.