{"id": "657", "question": "how to properly clean your hair", "gt": "Based on the given passages, here's a step-by-step guide on how to properly clean your hair:\n\n1. Select the proper shampoo and conditioner for your hair type.\n2. Wet your hair thoroughly.\n3. Apply a nickel-sized amount of shampoo into the palm of your hand and work it through your hair, combing through it with your fingers to reduce tangles if your hair is longer.\n4. Rinse the hair completely and use a wide-tooth comb to remove tangles and smooth the hair.\n5. Apply conditioner in the same manner as the shampoo and allow it to remain on for a few minutes.\n6. Rinse the hair with cool water and comb through it again.\n7. Dry the hair with a towel using a patting or stroking motion, avoiding rubbing it back and forth or in circles.\n8. Use a hair dryer to completely dry your hair.\n\nTherefore, the steps to properly clean your hair are:\n\n1. Choose the right products.\n2. Wet your hair.\n3. Shampoo your hair.\n4. Rinse and detangle.\n5. Condition your hair.\n6. Rinse and comb.\n7. Dry your hair with a towel.\n8. Use a hair dryer.", "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nResearch the recommended frequency and methods for washing your hair based on your hair type and any specific concerns you may have, such as oiliness or dryness.\nExamine the effectiveness of your current hair washing routine and identify any areas that need improvement.\nEvaluate the products used in your hair washing routine and consider alternatives that might better suit your hair's needs.\n\nUnable to answer based on given passages.", "time_sec": 40.449, "generation_time_seconds": 24.7047, "selection_time_seconds": 15.7447, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"phase": "rollout", "beam": 0, "token_ids": [28301, 1437,