{"id": "469", "question": "benefits of hiking as a hobby facts", "gt": "Sure! Based on the given passages, here are the benefits of hiking as a hobby:\n\n1. Outdoor hiking promotes mental health (Passage 1).\n2. Hiking can help increase your levels of vitamin D through exposure to sunshine (Passage 2).\n3. Hiking has a positive impact on combating symptoms of stress and anxiety (Passage 3).\n\nTherefore, the main benefits of hiking as a hobby are its positive effects on mental health, physical health, and stress reduction.", "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nIdentify the specific benefits mentioned in the passages about hiking as a hobby.\nGather examples, numbers, or comparisons from the passages that support the benefits of hiking.\nReview the passages to find evidence supporting each identified benefit of hiking.\n\nUnable to answer based on given passages.", "time_sec": 49.165, "generation_time_seconds": 23.6707, "selection_time_seconds": 25.4945, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"phase": "rollout", "beam": 0, "token_ids": [28301, 1437, 279, 3151, 7567, 315, 37364, 438, 264, 31528, 9733, 304, 279, 46769, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-1.218, -0.0028, -0.2499, -0.3399, -0.12, -0.1674, -0.0, -0.8415, -0.2398, -0.0, -0.2416, -0.0012, -0.0, -0.2803, -0.0494, -0.0401], "cumulative_logprob": -3.7919, "norm_logp": -0.237, "input_len": 139, "output_tokens": 16}, {"phase": "rollout", "beam": 0, "token_ids": [840, 19991, 279, 6961, 7567, 315, 37364, 438, 264, 31528, 1156, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-2.5573, -0.0082, -0.0428, -1.656, -2.4069, -0.5005, -0.0013, -1.6357, -1.4546, -0.0004, -8.6802, -0.3093, -0.0562], "cumulative_logprob": -19.3094, "norm_logp": -1.4853, "input_len": 139, "output_tokens": 13}, {"phase": "rollout", "beam": 0, "token_ids": [28301, 