{"id": "737", "question": "what is the difference between sms and mms", "gt": "Based on the given passages, SMS stands for Short Message Service and allows you to send a message of up to 160 characters to another device. In contrast, MMS (Multimedia Messaging Service) allows you to send a message including pictures, videos, sounds, text, or any combination of the four. The content of an MMS message has a maximum size of 300KB in extensions of WAV, JPEG, GIF, etc.", "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nStep 1: Identify the key characteristics of SMS and MMS from the given passages.\nStep 2: Compare the technical differences between SMS and MMS.\nStep 3: Provide a concise explanation of the differences, using specific examples or comparisons if applicable.\nStep 3: Elaborate on the differences between SMS and MMS, ensuring to cover aspects like message type, data capacity, delivery speed, and cost.\nStep 4: Summarize the key differences between SMS and MMS in a clear and concise manner.\n\nUnable to answer based on given passages.", "time_sec": 45.744, "generation_time_seconds": 27.1936, "selection_time_seconds": 18.5503, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"phase": "rollout", "beam": 0, "token_ids": [785, 32711, 7354, 525, 25, 4710], "logp_list": [-1.6722, -1.4012, -0.0293, -0.0712, -2.8382, -2.1058], "cumulative_logprob": -8.1179, "norm_logp": -1.353, "input_len": 141, "output_tokens": 6}, {"phase": "rollout", "beam": 0, "token_ids": [785, 1156, 3019, 374, 311, 23643, 279, 2661, 3405, 323, 279, 3897, 46769, 311, 3535, 1128, 1995, 374, 2567, 311, 4226, 279, 3405, 29257, 13, 576, 3405, 17064, 369, 279, 6672, 1948, 29909, 323, 386, 4826, 11, 773, 582, 1184, 311, 10542, 279, 1376, 86159, 1948, 1493, 1378, 4494, 315, 29522, 3516, 13, 1096, 2578, 2924, 11799, 3