{"id": "180", "question": "psychological effects of hugging", "gt": "Hugging has significant psychological effects. It creates a warm feeling that affects the entire body, akin to the effect of many drugs operating simultaneously. This could be due to the feeling of a loving embrace, leading to good relationships and emotional intimacy. It also enhances empathy and listening skills, which can lead to a psychological hug. Furthermore, research has found that hugging can significantly reduce worries about mortality and boost self-esteem. This soothing effect can be achieved even when hugging an inanimate object like a teddy bear.", "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "Answer: Unable to answer based on given passages.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nUnable to answer based on given passages.\nReview the given passage for any mention of psychological effects of hugging.\nLook for any direct statements about psychological effects. If there are none, then the answer is \"Unable to answer based on given passages.\"\n\nAnswer: Unable to answer based on given passages.", "time_sec": 45.603, "generation_time_seconds": 30.7867, "selection_time_seconds": 14.8165, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"phase": "rollout", "beam": 0, "token_ids": [17075, 311, 4226, 3118, 389, 2661, 46769, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-3.0002, -0.0, -0.0008, -0.0, 0.0, -0.0005, -0.0, -0.0037, -0.0], "cumulative_logprob": -3.0052, "norm_logp": -0.3339, "input_len": 137, "output_tokens": 9}, {"phase": "rollout", "beam": 0, "token_ids": [840, 19991, 279, 3151, 6239, 9733, 304, 279, 46769, 5435, 311, 279, 23187, 6239, 315, 305, 35268, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-2.1966, -0.0235, -0.0448, -0.4053, -2.0383, -1.0729, -0.0282, -0.0002, -0.8848, -1.0022, -0.0, -1.7465, -0.1543, -0.7983, -0.0, -0.0006, 0.0, -0.0902, -0.1766], "cumulative_logprob": -10.6633, "norm_logp": -0.5