{"id": "482", "question": "why is my snapchat temporarily locked", "gt": "Based on the given passages, Snapchat may temporarily lock an account if the user has been using third-party applications to access the app. These third-party apps can compromise the security of the account and put the user and their friends at risk. Snapchat may send a warning message before locking the account, but if the user continues to use third-party apps, their account may be locked.", "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nAnalyze the specific reasons why Snapchat might temporarily lock an account. Mention common issues such as multiple failed login attempts or suspicious activity detected by Snapchat's security protocols.\nExamine the security features of Snapchat that could lead to account locking, such as two-factor authentication (2FA) and how it might prevent unauthorized access.\nExamine the notifications or alerts that could indicate why Snapchat locked your account, such as failed login attempts or notifications about suspicious activity.\n\nUnable to answer based on given passages.", "time_sec": 49.038, "generation_time_seconds": 36.4275, "selection_time_seconds": 12.6107, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"phase": "rollout", "beam": 0, "token_ids": [16, 13, 64547, 279, 3151, 4265, 25, 576, 3405, 374, 10161, 3170, 55179, 374, 330, 3888, 96154, 16061, 10040, 17, 13, 29901, 279, 2266, 25, 55179, 374, 264, 3590, 3687, 5339, 11, 323, 279, 4647, 330, 3888, 96154, 16061, 1, 13230, 264, 13340, 37450, 311, 2615, 476, 990, 279, 906, 624, 18, 13, 21144, 3204, 7966, 369, 264, 13340, 5296, 25, 576, 7966, 1410, 2088, 504, 2692, 24301, 4152, 311, 4842, 26557, 11, 264, 13340, 61084, 304, 279, 1849, 11, 476, 458, 4265, 448, 279, 1196, 594, 3671, 476, 7602, 3633, 624, 19, 13, 37427