{"id": "580", "question": "what do i do if i got my sperrys wet", "gt": "Based on the given passages, if your Sperry shoes get wet, it is recommended to use a leather conditioner to help revitalize the leather and infuse moisture back into it. This is especially important if you wash your shoes with detergent, as it tends to dry out the leather. If you don't have a leather conditioner on hand, you can use a suede bar or leather brush to clean the shoes. It's best to avoid getting light tan Sperry shoes wet, as water might stain them. However, if you do get them wet, using a suede bar or leather brush should help remove any stains.", "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nI need to find information about how to handle Sperrys that are wet.\nI need to identify if the given passage contains information about handling wet Sperrys. If not, I should determine if there is any mention of how to handle wet shoes or shoes in general.\nI will now look for any information in the passage about how to handle wet shoes or Sperrys specifically.\n\nUnable to answer based on given passages.", "time_sec": 48.384, "generation_time_seconds": 26.9978, "selection_time_seconds": 21.3857, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"phase": "rollout", "beam": 0, "token_ids": [5338, 11, 358, 1184, 311, 8253, 421, 279, 3089, 615, 1047, 304, 3405, 525, 1865, 315, 46419, 476, 2477, 53951, 15780, 7236, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-4.8961, -0.023, -1.5564, -0.6699, -0.0002, -1.5686, -0.5845, -0.0585, -2.7681, -0.0056, -0.0, -3.1514, -0.0395, -0.0128, -2.9637, -0.0185, -1.2665, -1.6348, -1.7867, -0.0085, -0.0, -0.6085, -0.0725, -0.4306], "cumulative_logprob": -24.1249, "norm_logp": -1.0052, "input_len": 144, "output_tokens": 24}, {"phase": "rollout", "beam": 0, "token_ids": [2082, 55856, 279, 2108