{"id": "84", "question": "symptoms and causes of ibs", "gt": "Sure, I can help you with that! Here are the symptoms and causes of irritable bowel syndrome (IBS) based on the given passages:\n\nSymptoms:\n\n* Diarrhea (often described as violent episodes of diarrhea)\n* Constipation\n* Constipation alternating with diarrhea\n* Belly pains or cramps, usually in the lower half of the belly, that get worse after meals and feel better after a bowel movement\n* A lot of gas or bloating\n\nCauses:\n\n* Abnormal gastrointestinal (GI) tract movements\n* Increased awareness of bodily functions\n* Disruption in the communication between the brain and the GI tract\n* Alterations in the GI tract motility\n* Abnormal nervous system signals\n* Increased sensitivity to pain\n* Food intolerances\n* Poor absorption of sugars or acids in food\n\nIt's worth noting that the exact cause of IBS is still unknown, and it's believed to be a complex interaction of various factors.", "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "Answer: Unable to answer based on given passages.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nIdentify the specific symptoms and causes of IBS mentioned in the passages.\nSearch for a list or description of the symptoms and causes of IBS in the given passages.\nRead through both passages to find any explicit mention of the symptoms and causes of IBS.\n\nAnswer: Unable to answer based on given passages.", "time_sec": 48.19, "generation_time_seconds": 25.1466, "selection_time_seconds": 23.0428, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"phase": "rollout", "beam": 0, "token_ids": [19432, 279, 2661, 46769, 311, 10542, 279, 13495, 323, 11137, 315, 358, 7347, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-2.4245, -0.0125, -1.2527, -0.0808, -0.7431, -0.072, -1.6102, -1.0261, -0.0043, -0.0253, -0.0265, -0.0265, -0.0, -1.1065, -0.2543], "cumulative_logprob": -8.6653, "norm_logp": -0.5