{"id": "113", "question": "how are water shares transferred", "gt": "To transfer water shares, the seller must return the Water Stock Certificate that was assigned to them and sign the back of it. The new owner of the property must provide proof of ownership. A fee of $75.00 must be paid to process a Water Stock Certificate transfer. After these steps, a new Water Stock Certificate will be issued to the new owner. If the original certificate is lost, an additional fee of $75.00 must be paid when filing a Lost Certificate Affidavit form, which is furnished by the Company and must be signed and notarized.", "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nPlease provide the passage or relevant information so I can analyze it and answer the question accordingly.\nThe passage does not contain any information about how water shares are transferred.\nThe passage does not contain any information about how water shares are transferred.\n\nUnable to answer based on given passages.", "time_sec": 34.827, "generation_time_seconds": 26.2582, "selection_time_seconds": 8.5686, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"phase": "rollout", "beam": 0, "token_ids": [6025, 41018, 279, 6961, 3565, 11, 279, 1790, 19819, 3019, 374, 1447], "logp_list": [-6.9246, -0.9112, -0.0015, -0.5773, -0.0002, -1.126, -0.1428, -0.1058, -0.008, -1.9408, -0.2016, -3.9628], "cumulative_logprob": -15.9026, "norm_logp": -1.3252, "input_len": 137, "output_tokens": 12}, {"phase": "rollout", "beam": 0, "token_ids": [8304, 220, 16, 25, 64547, 279, 943, 315, 1995, 4362, 311, 4226, 279, 3405, 624, 8304, 220, 17, 25, 29901, 421, 279, 46769, 3410, 3151, 3565, 911, 1246, 3015, 13248, 525, 22409, 624, 8304, 220, 18, 25, 37427, 2986, 279, 1995, 3897, 304, 279, 46769, 311, 1824, 279, 4226, 624, 8304, 220, 19, 25, 1416, 279, 1