{"id": "181", "question": "psychological effects of hugging", "gt": "Hugging has physiological benefits and can have a similar effect on the body as certain drugs. It can also lead to emotional intimacy and happy relationships. Hugging and touch, even with inanimate objects, can help reduce existential fears and worry about mortality.", "pred": "The psychological effects of hugging mentioned in the passages include increased feelings of love and connection, reduced stress, and increased happiness.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "Answer: The psychological effects of hugging mentioned in the passages include increased feelings of love and connection, reduced stress, and increased happiness.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nAnalyze the given passages for information on the psychological effects of hugging.\nIdentify specific psychological effects mentioned in the passages, such as increased feelings of love and connection, reduced stress, or increased happiness.\nIdentify the specific psychological effects of hugging mentioned in the passages.\n\nAnswer: The psychological effects of hugging mentioned in the passages include increased feelings of love and connection, reduced stress, and increased happiness.", "time_sec": 42.77, "generation_time_seconds": 27.3454, "selection_time_seconds": 15.4245, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"phase": "rollout", "beam": 0, "token_ids": [2082, 55856, 279, 2661, 46769, 369, 1995, 389, 279, 23187, 6239, 315, 305, 35268, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-2.3752, -0.0, -0.0205, -3.0199, -1.0496, -0.5413, -2.4825, -1.2835, -0.2709, -0.0885, -0.0006, -0.0004, -0.0011, 0.0, -0.0867, -0.2642], "cumulative_logprob": -11.4849, "norm_logp": -0.7178, "input_len": 137, "output_tokens": 16}, {"phase": "rollout", "beam": 0, "token_ids": [17075, 311, 4226, 3118, 389, 2661, 46769, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-3.0002, -0.0, -0.0008, -0.0, 0.0, -0.0005, -0.0, -0.0