{"id": "380", "question": "what is dmso used for", "gt": "Based on the given passages, DMSO is used for various purposes, including:\n\n1. Industrial uses: As an antifreeze and solvent for a wide range of chemicals.\n2. Medical uses: To relieve pain, reduce swelling and inflammation, promote healing, and treat a variety of medical ailments such as burns, scleroderma, and soft tissue damage.\n3. Pain relief: For muscles and joints, and as a general pain reliever applied to the skin.\n4. Skin care: To penetrate skin and tissue and enter the bloodstream.\n\nTherefore, the answer to the question \"What is DMSO used for?\" can be summarized as: DMSO is used for various industrial, medical, and personal care purposes, including pain relief, wound healing, and skin care.", "pred": "DMSO is used in various applications, including as a solvent in chemical reactions, as a reagent in organic synthesis, and as a cosolvent in drug delivery systems. It is also used in the field of cryopreservation to protect cells and tissues during freezing and thawing processes.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "Answer: DMSO is used in various applications, including as a solvent in chemical reactions, as a reagent in organic synthesis, and as a cosolvent in drug delivery systems. It is also used in the field of cryopreservation to protect cells and tissues during freezing and thawing processes.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nReview the given passages to find specific information about the uses of DMSO. Look for details such as its applications in research, medical treatments, or its interaction with other substances.\nIdentify and list the various uses of DMSO mentioned in the passages. Note any specific applications or contexts where DMSO is used. Ensure to include examples or comparisons that are relevant to its uses.\nReview the given passages to find specific information about the uses of DMSO. Look for details such as its applications in research, medical treatments, or its interaction with other substances.\n\nAnswer: DMSO is used in various applications, including as a solvent in chemical reactions, as a reagent in organic synthesis, and as a cosolvent in drug delivery systems. It is also used in the field of cryopreservation to protect cells and tissues during freezing and thawing processes.", "time_sec": 57.093, "generation_time_seconds": 29.8704, "selection_time_seconds": 27.2228, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"phase": "rollout", "beam": 0, "token_ids": [840, 19991, 279, 2213, 315, 279, 2661, 46769, 369, 3151, 33845, 315, 422, 4826, 46, 323, 1181, 8357, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-1.7112, -0.0058, -0.0102, -3.4166, -0.0115, -0.0012, -1.1313, -0.0668, -0.7026, -2.0173, -0.3245, -0.0478, -0.5782, -0.0002, -0.0, -0.585, -0.0069, -1.6494, -0.109, -0.2687], "cumulative_logprob": -12.6442, "norm_logp": -0.6322, "input_len": 138, "output_tokens": 20}, {"phase": "rollout", "beam": 0, "token_ids": [19432, 279, 3897, 46769, 369, 894, 33845, 315, 422, 4826, 46, 323, 1181, 5711, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-2.4255, -0.005, -0.953, -0.0818, -0.7218, -0.1418, -1.8975, -0.0233, -0.479, -0.0001, -0.0, -0.1393, -0.0041, -0.1242, -0.0288, -0.4844], "cumulative_logprob": -7.5096, "norm_logp": -0.4693, "input_len": 138, "output_tokens": 16}, {"phase": "rollout", "beam": 0, "token_ids": [19432, 279, 2661, 46769, 311, 1477, 3151, 1995, 911, 279, 5711, 315, 422, 4826, 46, 13, 9192, 369, 3565, 1741, 438, 1181, 8357, 304, 3412, 11, 6457, 22183, 11, 476, 1181, 16230, 448, 1008, 32055, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-2.4255, -0.005, -0.953, -0.1562, -0.7287, -1.5115, -0.7076, -1.2092, -0.0311, -0.0719, -0.0103, -0.0031, -0.0823, -0.0003, -0.0, -0.0626, -0.748, -0.0, -1.7843, -0.4183, 0.0, -2.8735, -0.1472, -0.5307, -3.2721, -0.0115, -0.1253, -0.2539, -0.0, -0.0098, -5.0297, -4.8318, -0.0007, -0.2515, -0.0107, -0.0159, -0.1144], "cumulative_logprob": -28.3876, "norm_logp": -0.76