{"id": "439", "question": "how to find someone in france", "gt": "Based on the given passages, here's how to find someone in France:\n\n1. Use a people search website specifically designed for France, such as People Search France.\n2. Check the French white pages (in English) at PagesJaunes.fr. Instead of typing Paris in the City field, write IDF (or Ile de France) in the Dept district or region field to search for the person in Paris and its suburbs.\n3. Post a missed connection (MC) on Paris Craigslist.\n4. Visit the Pages Blanches (the French version of the white pages) at PagesJaunes.fr. Enter the last name of the person you're searching for in the Nom field, and optionally enter a first name in the Prenom field. Enter address information, if known, in the Ou section. Click Trouver to search for the name. The search results will display name, address, and phone number for all listings that match your search criteria.", "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nIdentifying additional methods to locate someone in France, such as using social media platforms or local directories.\nDetermining if the given passage provides sufficient information to answer the question about finding someone in France.\nIdentifying the content and context of the given passage to ensure it contains relevant information for locating someone in France.\n\nUnable to answer based on given passages.", "time_sec": 46.626, "generation_time_seconds": 23.348, "selection_time_seconds": 23.2776, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"phase": "rollout", "beam": 0, "token_ids": [28301, 7766, 5107, 5413, 311, 24523, 4325, 304, 9625, 11, 1741, 438, 1667, 3590, 3687, 15409, 476, 2205, 28625, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-1.51, -5.1842, -8.6387, -2.9004, -2.3223, -0.486, -0.0994, -0.0051, -0.0007, -1