{"id": "715", "question": "what exercises tone the chest", "gt": "Based on the given passages, the exercises that tone the chest are:\n\n1. Modified tri-set for the chest (mentioned in passage 2)\n2. Pushups with heavy sets of dumbbell bench presses (mentioned in passage 2)\n\nThese exercises are designed to pump the pecs and stretch the connective tissue surrounding them, allowing for more muscle growth.", "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nIdentify the specific exercises mentioned in the given passages that target the chest muscles.\nLook for any mention of chest exercises or exercises that specifically target the pectoral muscles in the given passages.\nAnalyze the information provided in the passages to determine which specific exercises are mentioned as toning the chest.\n\nUnable to answer based on given passages.", "time_sec": 38.434, "generation_time_seconds": 23.699, "selection_time_seconds": 14.7345, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"phase": "rollout", "beam": 0, "token_ids": [28301, 1437, 3151, 22932, 9733, 304, 279, 46769, 429, 2169, 279, 15138, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-1.1459, -0.008, -2.419, -0.0894, -0.4345, -0.011, -0.0, -0.2189, -0.007, -0.1645, -0.0196, -0.0, -1.8354, -0.0576], "cumulative_logprob": -6.4108, "norm_logp": -0.4579, "input_len": 137, "output_tokens": 14}, {"phase": "rollout", "beam": 0, "token_ids": [8304, 220, 16, 25, 64547, 279, 1376, 6813, 315, 279, 3405, 624, 12, 576, 3405, 17064, 911, 22932, 429, 16232, 279, 15138, 624, 12, 1205, 1184, 311, 5244, 389, 22932, 429, 5961, 2169, 279, 15138, 23648, 382], "logp_list": [-2.9316, -0.0029, -0.0634, -0.0007, -0.0356, -0.099, -0.8552, -1.2946, -0.0095, -0.0264, -0.0021, -0.5431, -1.5189, -0.1212, -0.016, -0.1554, -0.0821, -0.0068, -0.0011, -0.0402, -0.0, -0.0, -0.4027, -0