{"id": "51", "question": "benefits of a water pick", "gt": "A water pick has several benefits, according to the given passages. It can help eliminate germs and plaque that are difficult to remove with a toothbrush. It can also massage and stimulate soft tissue in the mouth, reducing the risk of gingivitis. Additionally, a water pick can clean better around the teeth and gums, reaching areas that brushing may not be able to access.", "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nIdentify the specific information in the passages regarding the benefits of a water pick.\nAnalyze the benefits of a water pick as presented in the passages, noting any specific advantages or features mentioned.\nLook for any comparisons or contrasts between a water pick and traditional toothbrushes in the passages to highlight unique advantages.\n\nUnable to answer based on given passages.", "time_sec": 42.243, "generation_time_seconds": 30.502, "selection_time_seconds": 11.7413, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"phase": "rollout", "beam": 0, "token_ids": [28301, 1437, 279, 3151, 7567, 315, 264, 3015, 3735, 9733, 304, 279, 46769, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-1.2821, -0.0019, -0.115, -0.3087, -0.1219, -0.54, -0.0946, -0.0, -0.0001, -0.3455, -0.0007, -0.0, -0.4663, -0.0554, -0.0149], "cumulative_logprob": -3.3471, "norm_logp": -0.2231, "input_len": 137, "output_tokens": 15}, {"phase": "rollout", "beam": 0, "token_ids": [10380, 369, 3151, 10295, 476, 35495, 304, 279, 21085, 429, 11167, 279, 7567, 315, 264, 3015, 3735, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-3.6035, -0.0161, -0.4284, -1.8958, -0.5331, -0.5391, -0.8222, -0.0, -0.4461, -0.3249, -1.0867, -0.0166, -0.0032, -0.0007, -0.2953, -0.0, -0.0001, -0.0595, -0.0379], "cumulative_logprob": -10.1092, "norm_logp": -0.5321, "input_len": 137, "output_toke