{"id": "260", "question": "the benefits of msm powder", "gt": "MSM powder offers several benefits. It helps get oxygen into the blood more efficiently, thereby increasing energy levels. It also makes cell walls more permeable. The powder aids in the absorption of more nutrients, particularly when paired with Co-enzyme Q10. Additionally, MSM powder can help relieve muscular aches and pains and reduce inflammation due to injury or inflammatory diseases such as arthritis.", "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nExamine the specific details provided in the passages, focusing on how MSM powder is described and any benefits mentioned.\nIdentify the specific benefits mentioned in the passages, and ensure to provide examples or comparisons where applicable.\nLook for any mentions of specific health outcomes or conditions that MSM powder is said to address, and note any specific examples or comparisons provided.\n\nUnable to answer based on given passages.", "time_sec": 44.597, "generation_time_seconds": 28.6879, "selection_time_seconds": 15.9012, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"phase": "rollout", "beam": 0, "token_ids": [19432, 279, 2661, 46769, 311, 10542, 894, 3151, 33845, 315, 279, 7567, 315, 58588, 16723, 13, 9192, 369, 3565, 429, 10339, 1246, 476, 3170, 279, 7567, 12170, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-3.1158, -0.0097, -1.1081, -0.0398, -0.5661, -0.0699, -1.025, -0.9585, -3.0885, -0.0716, -0.0606, -0.0004, -0.0027, -6.609, -0.0, -0.0258, -1.247, -0.0002, -0.5707, -4.5898, -2.1971, -0.3732, -2.3957, -0.0232, -3.7409, -0.0708, -0.9496, -0.1878, -0.0624], "cumulative_logprob": -33.1599, "norm_logp": -1.1434, "input_len": 137, "output_tokens": 29}, {"phase": "rollout", "beam": 0, "token_ids": [840, 19991, 279, 3151, 15057, 311, 67491, 16723, 304, 279, 3897, 4676