{"id": "461", "question": "benefits of cupping massage", "gt": "Cupping massage has several benefits. It is known to help eliminate toxins from the body and improve blood circulation. It also aids in pain relief by reducing tissue inflammation, which subsequently improves flexibility and increases range of motion. Additionally, cupping massage has mental benefits such as decreasing anxiety and depression.", "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nReview the provided passages to identify specific benefits mentioned about cupping massage. Look for key details such as physical effects, health improvements, or testimonials.\nLook for any mentions of specific physical effects or health improvements attributed to cupping massage in the passages provided.\nAnalyze the physical effects or health improvements attributed to cupping massage mentioned in the passages.\n\nUnable to answer based on given passages.", "time_sec": 50.078, "generation_time_seconds": 24.2238, "selection_time_seconds": 25.8538, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"phase": "rollout", "beam": 0, "token_ids": [28301, 1437, 279, 3151, 7567, 9733, 304, 279, 2661, 46769, 911, 10525, 9989, 6245, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-1.1854, -0.0023, -0.1345, -0.6668, -0.2918, -0.7957, -0.0276, -0.0001, -2.4917, -0.0676, -1.2737, -0.0018, 0.0, -0.0006, -0.0358, -0.026], "cumulative_logprob": -7.0014, "norm_logp": -0.4376, "input_len": 137, "output_tokens": 16}, {"phase": "rollout", "beam": 0, "token_ids": [47504, 323, 23643, 1995, 504, 279, 3897, 46769, 911, 10525, 9989, 6245, 7567, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-5.6051, -1.7867, -0.3097, -1.4988, -0.5286, -0.0053, -2.5523, -0.076, -0.2918, -1.2377, 0.0, -0.0021, -0.7933, -0.0348, -0.1082], "cumulative_logprob": -14.8304, "norm_logp": -0.9887, "input_len": 137, "ou