{"id": "542", "question": "what traits do people have that are born in october?", "gt": "People born in October are described as having a keen interest in and an eye for form and structure, which can make them good architects, interior decorators, designers, or any profession that combines art and structure. They are also described as success-oriented, charming, and personally powerful individuals. They are at their best when they are in control, their own boss, or working on their own. They can also get along with others and possess necessary \"people skills\", although they can occasionally show impatience. Despite being restless at heart, they crave stability and security, which is why they work hard at whatever they do.", "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nStep 1: Identify the question\nThe question asks about traits associated with people born in October.\nStep 2: Analyze the given information\nExamine the provided passages for any information related to traits of people born in October. Look for any specific details or examples that might help answer the question.\nStep 3: Look for any relevant information or examples in the passages that could indicate traits associated with people born in October.\n\nUnable to answer based on given passages.", "time_sec": 43.514, "generation_time_seconds": 27.9538, "selection_time_seconds": 15.5604, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"phase": "rollout", "beam": 0, "token_ids": [17075, 311, 4226, 3118, 389, 2661, 46769, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-2.0003, 0.0, -0.0002, -0.0, 0.0, -0.0005, -0.0, -0.003, -0.0], "cumulative_logprob": -2.004, "norm_logp": -0.2227, "input_len": 143, "output_tokens": 9}, {"phase": "rollout", "beam": 0, "token_ids": [2082, 55856, 279, 2661, 3405, 311, 3535, 1128, 374, 1660, 4588, 13, 5