{"id": "627", "question": "how to guard a tall person in basketball", "gt": "To guard a tall person in basketball, you should stay close to them when they are near the three-point line, actively sliding your feet to minimize shot opportunities (passage 1). It is important to create a wedge between the basket and the offensive player to defend against a tall player (passage 3).", "pred": "Finally, communication with your teammates is essential. Ensure that you are aware of their positions and can coordinate effectively to double-team or switch if necessary. This helps in covering more ground and increasing the pressure on the tall player.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "Finally, communication with your teammates is essential. Ensure that you are aware of their positions and can coordinate effectively to double-team or switch if necessary. This helps in covering more ground and increasing the pressure on the tall player.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nIdentify the key attributes of a tall person in basketball to understand their strengths and weaknesses.\nThink about how to exploit the tall person's height advantage in different positions on the court.\nAnalyze the common strategies used in basketball to guard a tall player, focusing on defensive postures, footwork, and positioning.\n\nAnswer: To guard a tall person in basketball, it's crucial to understand their strengths and weaknesses. Tall players often have an advantage in rebounding and blocking shots due to their height. To exploit this, focus on positioning yourself under the basket or near the paint to contest shots and rebounds effectively.\n\nAdditionally, consider using a defensive posture that allows you to stay in front of the tall player, maintaining a low stance with your knees bent and your body angled to block their path. This helps in preventing them from driving to the basket or passing easily.\n\nFootwork is also key. Stay agile and move quickly to adjust your position as the tall player moves. Use quick, short steps to maintain your defensive stance and prevent them from getting an easy shot or pass.\n\nFinally, communication with your teammates is essential. Ensure that you are aware of their positions and can coordinate effectively to double-team or switch if necessary. This helps in covering more ground and increasing the pressure on the tall player.", "time_sec": 56.484, "generation_time_seconds": 29.9378, "selection_time_seconds": 26.5462, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"phase": "rollout", "beam": 0, "token_ids": [785, 1995, 3897, 1558, 537, 6644, 894, 3151, 3565, 911, 1246, 311, 7616, 264, 16217, 1697, 304, 19240, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-2.4575, -6.3464, -0.2071, -0.7745, -0.0, -0.5727, -0.9915, -0.4228, -0.1152, -0.6162, -1.2742, -0.0001, -0.0016, -0.0008, -0.0001, -0.0026, -0.0001, -0.0, -0.0132, -0.237], "cumulative_logprob": -14.0336, "norm_logp": -0.7017, "input_len": 140, "output_tokens": 20}, {"phase": "rollout", "beam": 0, "token_ids": [2082, 55856, 279, 6961, 8201, 315, 279, 16217, 1697, 323, 279, 38725, 14830, 1483, 311, 7616, 1105, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-1.9218, -0.0, -0.0476, -0.6871, -0.2259, -0.8935, -0.8798, -0.0071, -0.219, -0.9531, -2.2542, -3.4964, -2.0477, -2.5474, -1.021, -0.1224, -0.0207, -0.8706, -0.0152], "cumulative_logprob": -18.2305, "norm_logp": -0.9595, "input_len": 140, "output_tokens": 19}, {"phase": "rollout", "beam": 0, "token_ids": [840, 19991, 279, 6961, 8201, 323, 5619, 1707, 315, 279, 16217, 2781, 311, 3535, 862, 8170, 323, 43567, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-2.2789, -0.0163, -0.072, -1.6599, -0.1803, -0.5337, -0.8055, -0.007, -0.0002, -0.08, -0.003, -0.6377, -0.6581, -0.7947, -0.0775, -6.9951, -0.1173, -0.1041, -0.0311, -0.0079], "cumulative_logprob": -15.0603, "norm_logp": -0.753, "input_len": 140, "output_tokens": 20}, {"phase": "rollout", "beam": 0, "token_ids": [28301, 1437, 279, 1376, 8201, 315, 264, 16