{"id": "115", "question": "how are water shares transferred", "gt": "Based on the given passages, water shares can be transferred through the issuance of a new Water Stock Certificate to the new owner of record after paying a fee of $75.00. The seller must return the Water Stock Certificate assigned to them and sign the back of the certificate. The new owner must provide proof of ownership before a transfer can be processed. Additionally, an additional fee of $75.00 must be paid when filing a Lost Certificate Affidavit form, which is furnished by the company and must be signed and notarized.", "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nExamine the specific examples, numbers, or comparisons mentioned in the passages regarding the transfer of water shares.\nLook for sentences or paragraphs that describe the process or mechanisms involved in the transfer of water shares.\nIdentify any specific terminology or legal frameworks mentioned in the passages that relate to the transfer of water shares.\n\nUnable to answer based on given passages.", "time_sec": 37.769, "generation_time_seconds": 27.856, "selection_time_seconds": 9.9127, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"phase": "rollout", "beam": 0, "token_ids": [840, 19991, 279, 3151, 10295, 11, 5109, 11, 476, 35495, 9733, 304, 279, 46769, 8826, 279, 8317, 315, 3015, 13248, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-1.4335, -0.0096, -0.0368, -0.2566, -0.8145, -0.4195, -0.0005, -0.0011, -0.0024, -0.0009, -1.2882, -0.0364, -0.0003, -0.5767, -0.6877, -0.8906, -0.0067, -0.005, -0.0, -0.0001, -0.0122, -0.078], "cumulative_logprob": -6.5573, "norm_logp": -0.2981, "input_len": 137, "output_tokens": 22}, {"phase": "rollout", "beam": 0, "token_ids": [28301, 1437, 279, 9760, 1995, 911, 3015, 4332, 30611, 504, 279, 2661, 46769, 13, 151645], "lo