{"id": "702", "question": "what do children learn with water play", "gt": "Children learn various skills and concepts through water play. They develop gross motor skills by running through sprinklers and pouring water. Water play also provides opportunities for academic learning, such as understanding concepts like floating and sinking, measuring water, and comparing quantities. Additionally, water play encourages creativity and imagination as children pretend and engage in imaginative play with water.", "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nExamine the specific types of water play activities described in the passages and their potential educational benefits.\nExamine the specific types of water play activities described in the passages and their potential educational benefits.\nExamine the specific types of water play activities described in the passages and their potential educational benefits.\n\nUnable to answer based on given passages.", "time_sec": 40.79, "generation_time_seconds": 25.1425, "selection_time_seconds": 15.6471, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"phase": "rollout", "beam": 0, "token_ids": [28301, 1437, 279, 1376, 13566, 315, 3015, 1486, 429, 646, 387, 13166, 304, 2841, 594, 7709, 323, 6832, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-1.7852, -0.0033, -0.1777, -1.3048, -1.2444, -0.0167, -0.0567, -0.0001, -1.0472, -3.1225, -0.5334, -4.6872, -0.3752, -1.3679, -0.1932, -0.1247, -0.5757, -1.4906, -0.5353, -0.028], "cumulative_logprob": -18.6698, "norm_logp": -0.9335, "input_len": 139, "output_tokens": 20}, {"phase": "rollout", "beam": 0, "token_ids": [8304, 220, 16, 25, 64547, 279, 1376, 6813, 315, 279, 3405, 624, 785, 3405, 17064, 911, 1128, 2841, 3960, 1526, 3015, 1486, 13, 1096, 23945, 582, 1265, 1401, 369, 1995, 429, 14758, 279, 16229, 7567, 476, 7361,