{"id": "53", "question": "benefits of a water pick", "gt": "Based on the provided passages, the benefits of using a water pick (also known as a Waterpik) include:\n\n1. Helping to keep teeth, gums, mouth, and overall body healthier by eliminating germs and plaque.\n2. Being a great oral care tool for removing food from areas that brushing cannot access.\n3. Massaging and stimulating soft tissue in the mouth to reduce the risk of gingivitis.\n4. Being an alternative to flossing and potentially offering similar benefits.\n\nUnable to answer based on given passages. The passages do not provide information on other potential benefits of using a water pick, such as its ability to reach areas between teeth or its effectiveness in reducing plaque buildup.", "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nIdentify the specific information in the passages regarding the benefits of a water pick.\nAnalyze the benefits of a water pick as presented in the passages, noting any specific advantages or features mentioned.\nLook for any comparisons or contrasts between a water pick and traditional toothbrushes in the passages to highlight unique advantages.\n\nUnable to answer based on given passages.", "time_sec": 42.429, "generation_time_seconds": 30.9957, "selection_time_seconds": 11.4332, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"phase": "rollout", "beam": 0, "token_ids": [28301, 1437, 279, 3151, 7567, 315, 264, 3015, 3735, 9733, 304, 279, 46769, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-1.2821, -0.0019, -0.115, -0.3087, -0.1219, -0.54, -0.0946, -0.0, -0.0001, -0.3455, -0.0007, -0.0, -0.4663, -0.0554, -0.0149], "cumulative_logprob": -3.3471, "norm_logp": -0.2231, "input_len": 137, "output_tokens": 15}, {"phase": "rollout", "beam": 0, "token_ids": [10380, 369, 3151, 10295, 476, 35495, 304, 279, 2108