{"id": "77", "question": "how to cook brats", "gt": "To cook brats, follow these steps:\n\n1. Preheat an outdoor grill for medium-high heat.\n2. Lightly oil the grate.\n3. Prick the bratwurst with a fork to prevent them from exploding as they cook.\n4. Place the bratwurst in a large pot with onions, butter, and beer.\n5. Place the pot over medium heat and simmer for 15 to 20 minutes.\n6. Remove the bratwurst from the beer mixture and continue cooking on the preheated grill for 10 to 14 minutes, turning occasionally.\n7. Serve with the beer mixture as a topping or side.", "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nExamine the given passages to find specific instructions or methods for cooking brats.\nLook for any specific steps or tips provided in the passages about preparing or cooking brats.\nLook for any additional context or preparation steps that might be implicit in the passage.\n\nUnable to answer based on given passages.", "time_sec": 54.888, "generation_time_seconds": 32.0379, "selection_time_seconds": 22.85, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"phase": "rollout", "beam": 0, "token_ids": [17075, 311, 4226, 3118, 389, 2661, 46769, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-4.8957, -0.0, -0.0002, -0.0, 0.0, -0.0006, -0.0, -0.0059, -0.0001], "cumulative_logprob": -4.9025, "norm_logp": -0.5447, "input_len": 137, "output_tokens": 9}, {"phase": "rollout", "beam": 0, "token_ids": [785, 2661, 3405, 374, 330, 5158, 311, 4296, 1411, 1862, 1189, 576, 32711, 7354, 3897, 773, 3041, 653, 537, 3410, 894, 3151, 1995, 389, 279, 17233, 1882, 369, 1411, 1862, 13, 4354, 11, 279, 7600, 374, 311, 23643, 279, 6961, 3565, 3019, 553, 3019, 11, 892, 23945, 429, 279, 1790, 19819, 3019, 1035, 387, 311, 2908, 279, 6961, 17452, 315, 1411, 1862, 323, 1246, 807, 2578, 10173, 279, 17233, 1882, 13, 87