{"id": "251", "question": "how to grill pork chops, allrecipes.com", "gt": "To grill pork chops according to the instructions provided in Allrecipes.com, follow these steps: \n\n1. Preheat an outdoor grill for medium heat. \n2. Lightly oil the grate. \n3. Mix together seasoned salt, black pepper, garlic powder, onion powder, paprika, Worcestershire sauce, and smoke flavoring until well combined. \n4. Rinse pork chops and sprinkle them with the spice mixture on both sides. \n5. Massage the spice rub into the meat and let it stand for 10 minutes. \n6. Grill the chops over indirect heat for about 12 minutes per side, or until they are no longer pink inside.", "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe reasoning step is: \"Search for the recipe 'how to grill pork chops' on the Allrecipes website.\"\nThe reasoning step is: \"Navigate to the Allrecipes website and search for the recipe 'how to grill pork chops'.\"\nThe reasoning step is: \"Click on the first recipe that appears in the search results for 'how to grill pork chops' on the Allrecipes website.\"\nThe reasoning step is: \"Read the recipe instructions carefully to understand the preparation steps for grilling pork chops.\"\n\nUnable to answer based on given passages.", "time_sec": 50.672, "generation_time_seconds": 33.1147, "selection_time_seconds": 17.5572, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"phase": "rollout", "beam": 0, "token_ids": [785, 2661, 3405, 374, 10887, 1995, 389, 1246, 311, 39058, 35067, 90078, 504, 2009, 49859, 905, 13, 4354, 11, 279, 3897, 21085, 1558, 537, 6644, 894, 1995, 911, 1081, 9400, 35067, 90078, 476, 2009, 49859, 905, 13, 15277, 11, 279, 21085, 1558, 537, 3410, 3322, 1995, 311, 4226, 279, 3405, 382], "logp_list": [-1.3393, -1.9496, -0.0687, -1.2894, -3.5843, -0.8521, -0.1187, -0