{"id": "325", "question": "how well do patterned rollers work", "gt": "Based on the given passages, it appears that patterned rollers can work well for creating textured finishes on walls, as they can produce a random pattern of texture that is often desired in faux finishing techniques. The third passage provides instructions for creating a DIY texture roller by modifying an existing roller pad with rubber bands to create clumps and random patterns, which can be used to apply paint and create a textured finish.\n\nTherefore, the answer to the question \"How well do patterned rollers work?\" is:\n\nThey can work well for creating textured finishes on walls, especially when used with faux finishing techniques.", "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nExamine the specific examples or numbers mentioned about the effectiveness of patterned rollers in the passages.\nAnalyze the comparisons or contrasts made in the passages regarding the effectiveness of patterned rollers versus other types of rollers.\nCompare the features and benefits of patterned rollers to those of other types of rollers to understand their relative effectiveness.\n\nUnable to answer based on given passages.", "time_sec": 39.691, "generation_time_seconds": 25.055, "selection_time_seconds": 14.6358, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"phase": "rollout", "beam": 0, "token_ids": [8304, 220, 16, 25, 70894, 279, 2266, 323, 6200, 315, 279, 3405, 624, 785, 3405, 17064, 911, 279, 26279, 476, 5068, 315, 5383, 291, 88613, 13, 1084, 23945, 279, 1184, 311, 15442, 279, 14944, 476, 15024, 315, 1493, 88613, 382], "logp_list": [-3.3455, -0.0077, -0.0611, -0.0009, -3.5478, -0.0181, -0.2834, -1.4188, -3.6715, -0.0345, -0.0, -0.001, -0.5719, -0.0499, -0.0109, -0.2202, -0.012, -0.002, -0.0371, -0.9969, -0.049, 