{"id": "497", "question": "salary exchange pension contributions", "gt": "Based on the given passages, it appears that salary exchange is a way for employees to give up part of their salary in exchange for a pension contribution made by their employer. The salary that is waived is equal to the value of the employee's regular pension contribution, minus any additional contributions. The employer then pays the corresponding amount into the relevant pension scheme. This arrangement allows both employers and employees to potentially save money through reduced national insurance contributions.", "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nPlease provide the passages or text to continue with the reasoning process.\nUnable to answer based on given passages.\nUnable to answer based on given passages.\n\nUnable to answer based on given passages.", "time_sec": 29.786, "generation_time_seconds": 22.2405, "selection_time_seconds": 7.5458, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"phase": "rollout", "beam": 0, "token_ids": [22524, 1495, 279, 3405, 1119, 1376, 6813, 25, 16107, 9289, 11, 27681, 19026, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-6.104, -0.0387, -0.009, -0.3781, -0.4132, -0.6709, -0.0359, -0.2031, -0.8395, -0.9967, -0.1011, -0.0008, -0.8877, -0.1531, -0.3961], "cumulative_logprob": -11.2279, "norm_logp": -0.7485, "input_len": 136, "output_tokens": 15}, {"phase": "rollout", "beam": 0, "token_ids": [5501, 3410, 279, 46769, 773, 358, 646, 23643, 1105, 323, 4226, 279, 3405, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-3.6933, -0.0449, -0.0039, -0.2888, -2.15, -0.4005, -0.0, -0.0653, -0.367, -0.3122, -0.7539, -0.0793, -0.0, -1.2707, -0.0002], "cumulative_logprob": -9.43, "norm_logp": -0.6287, "input_len": 136, "output_tokens": 15}, {"phase": "rollout", "beam": 0, "token_ids": [28301, 1437, 279, 9760, 199