{"id": "629", "question": "how to guard a tall person in basketball", "gt": "Based on the provided passages, here are some strategies for guarding a tall person in basketball:\n\n1. Stay as close as possible to a tall, skilled shooter when you guard them near the three-point line and actively slide your feet from side to side to stay near your opponent and minimize shot opportunities (Passage 1).\n2. Keep a wedge between the basket and the offensive player to defend against a tall player (Passage 3).\n\nTherefore, to guard a tall person in basketball, it is important to stay close to them and create a barrier between them and the basket. These strategies can help limit their shooting opportunities and make it more difficult for them to score.", "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nDetermine the height difference between the tall player and the defender.\nAnalyze the defender's height and identify the areas where the tall player has an advantage.\nIdentify the defender's specific strengths and weaknesses, such as their height, reach, and defensive skills.\n\nUnable to answer based on given passages.", "time_sec": 57.044, "generation_time_seconds": 23.1282, "selection_time_seconds": 33.9159, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"phase": "rollout", "beam": 0, "token_ids": [5501, 1946, 279, 1790, 19819, 32711, 3019, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-4.6003, -7.4904, -0.0178, -3.7775, -0.3416, -0.0596, -0.0025, -0.2986, -0.0021], "cumulative_logprob": -16.5904, "norm_logp": -1.8434, "input_len": 140, "output_tokens": 9}, {"phase": "rollout", "beam": 0, "token_ids": [16250, 2685, 279, 2266, 315, 279, 6961, 17452, 315, 16217, 4217, 304, 19240, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-3.261, -0.0009, -0.0188, -3.0877, -0.9959, -0.2722, -7.2502, -2.3776, -0.2234, -2.616, -0.3044, -0.