{"id": "637", "question": "health benefits to jalapenos", "gt": "Jalapenos have numerous health benefits due to their capsaicin content. They have pain-killing properties and can serve as a natural nasal decongestant. They may also aid in weight loss and prevent heart disease, heart attacks, and possibly even cancer. Additionally, jalapenos are full of vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants. They can also help increase cardiovascular health and defend heart health.", "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "Answer: Unable to answer based on given passages.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nIdentify the specific health benefits associated with jalapenos mentioned in the passages.\nCollect and summarize the health benefits for jalapenos as mentioned in the passages.\nIdentify any specific health benefits or nutrients mentioned for jalapenos, such as vitamins, minerals, or antioxidants.\n\nAnswer: Unable to answer based on given passages.", "time_sec": 54.481, "generation_time_seconds": 24.4439, "selection_time_seconds": 30.0369, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"phase": "rollout", "beam": 0, "token_ids": [28301, 1437, 279, 3151, 2820, 7567, 9733, 304, 279, 46769, 5435, 311, 75974, 391, 70870, 151645], "logp_list": [-1.1587, -0.0019, -0.3344, -0.281, -0.0255, -0.0005, -0.4819, -0.3094, -0.0007, -0.5411, -0.1597, -0.0, -0.0001, -0.0014, -0.0019, -3.6086], "cumulative_logprob": -6.9068, "norm_logp": -0.4317, "input_len": 138, "output_tokens": 16}, {"phase": "rollout", "beam": 0, "token_ids": [8304, 220, 16, 25, 37427, 2986, 279, 3151, 2820, 7567, 5815, 448, 75974, 391, 70870, 304, 279, 2661, 46769, 624, 8304, 220, 17, 25, 1759, 700, 279, 10820, 2820, 7567, 624, 8304, 220, 18, 25, 39565, 10295, 11, 5109, 11, 476, 35495, 429, 1824, 1817, 2820, 8760, 624, 8304, 220, 19, 25, 29279, 678, 3565, 12613, 279, 4226, 525, 5230, 2041, 7842, 9250, 19