{"id": "677", "question": "benefits and side effects of drinking clove tea", "gt": "Based on the given passages, the benefits of drinking clove tea include soothing the senses, relieving stress, providing relief from abdominal pain and aiding digestion. The side effects of drinking clove tea are not mentioned in the given passages.", "pred": "Improves digestion, reduces pain, boosts immunity", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "Answer: Improves digestion, reduces pain, boosts immunity", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nRead the passages closely to identify specific benefits and side effects of drinking clove tea mentioned in them.\nAnalyze the identified information to determine the benefits and side effects of drinking clove tea, distinguishing between them clearly.\nBased on the given passage, clove tea has several benefits, including:\n1. Improves digestion - Clove tea can help to improve digestion and reduce bloating. It does so by relaxing the muscles in the digestive tract, which can help to prevent gas build-up and bloating.\n2. Reduces pain - Clove tea contains an ingredient called eugenol, which is known for its pain-relieving properties. It can be used to relieve pain from headaches, muscle strains, and other types of pain.\n3. Boosts immunity - Clove tea can boost the immune system by increasing the production of white blood cells, which\n\nAnswer: Improves digestion, reduces pain, boosts immunity", "time_sec": 49.96, "generation_time_seconds": 28.1753, "selection_time_seconds": 21.785, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"phase": "rollout", "beam": 0, "token_ids": [19432, 279, 3897, 46769, 369, 894, 1995, 389, 279, 7567, 323, 3108, 6239, 315, 16163, 5292, 586, 15243, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-2.3926, -0.0125, -0.8107, -0.0254, -0.5567, -0.3225, -1.1874, -2.2017, -0.087, -0.0146, -0.1149, -0.017, -0.0, -0.0003, -0.0349, -0.0, 0.0, -0.0, -0.0177, -0.6702], "cumulative_