{"id": "54", "question": "benefits of a water pick", "gt": "Based on the given passages, the benefits of a water pick include:\n\n* Helping to keep teeth, gums, mouth, and overall body healthier by eliminating pesky germs and plaque that are difficult to remove with a toothbrush.\n* Massaging and stimulating soft tissue in the mouth to reduce the risk of gingivitis.\n* Cleaning better around the teeth and gums, removing food particles from areas that brushing cannot access.\n\nTherefore, using a water pick can be an effective addition to your oral hygiene routine, complementing traditional brushing and flossing methods.", "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nIdentify the specific benefits mentioned in the passage related to a water pick. Look for details such as improved gum health, plaque removal, ease of use, etc.\nIdentify any comparisons or contrasts made between a water pick and other dental hygiene tools or methods. This can help highlight unique advantages or benefits specific to water picks.\nIdentify any specific examples or anecdotes shared in the passage about the effectiveness of a water pick compared to traditional brushing or flossing. This can provide real-world evidence of the benefits mentioned.\n\nUnable to answer based on given passages.", "time_sec": 58.223, "generation_time_seconds": 37.0489, "selection_time_seconds": 21.1737, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"phase": "rollout", "beam": 0, "token_ids": [28301, 1437, 279, 3151, 7567, 315, 264, 3015, 3735, 438, 7481, 304, 279, 2661, 46769, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-1.2821, -0.0019, -0.115, -0.3087, -0.1219, -0.54, -0.0946, -0.0, -0.0001, -1.5955, -1.4322, -0.0068, -0.0, -0.9155, -0.0167, -0.034, -0.0463], "cumulative_logprob": -6.5113, "norm_logp": -0.383, "input_len": 137, "output