{"id": "100", "question": "how to sync audiobook from iphone to itunes", "gt": "To sync an audiobook from iPhone to iTunes, follow these steps:\n\n1. Open iTunes on your computer.\n2. Turn on the Manually manage music setting in iTunes.\n3. Download the audiobook from iTunes onto your iPhone.\n4. Connect your iPhone to the USB cable and plug the other end of the USB cable into a USB port on the computer.\n5. Wait for iTunes to sync the audiobook to your iPhone.\n6. After the sync is complete, the audiobook will be on your iPhone.", "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe question asks about syncing audiobooks from an iPhone to iTunes. To answer this, we need to identify the relevant information from the given passages. The first step is to locate the specific sections or sentences that discuss the process of syncing audiobooks from an iPhone to iTunes.\nRead the given passage and find the section that explains how to sync audiobooks from an iPhone to iTunes. Look for any instructions or steps that are mentioned.\nAfter identifying the section or sentence that explains how to sync audiobooks from an iPhone to iTunes, analyze the information provided. Confirm if the passage offers specific instructions, tools, or methods necessary to sync audiobooks, as well as any potential challenges or necessary precautions.\n\nUnable to answer based on given passages.", "time_sec": 53.666, "generation_time_seconds": 35.9088, "selection_time_seconds": 17.7567, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"phase": "rollout", "beam": 0, "token_ids": [17075, 311, 4226, 3118, 389, 2661, 46769, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-2.1967, 0.0, -0.0001, -0.0, 0.0, -0.0005, -0.0, -0.0083, -0.0001], "cumulative_logprob": -2.2057, "norm_logp": -0.2451, "input_len": 142, "output_tokens": 9}, {"pha