{"id": "265", "question": "the benefits of msm powder", "gt": "Based on the given passages, the benefits of MSM powder include:\n\n* Helping to increase oxygen efficiency in the blood\n* Increasing energy levels by making cell walls more permeable\n* Enhancing nutrient absorption, particularly when taken with Co-enzyme Q10\n* Relieving muscular aches and pains\n* Reducing inflammation due to injury or inflammatory diseases such as arthritis\n\nTherefore, MSM powder has several benefits for overall health and wellness, including improved oxygenation, energy, and reduction of pain and inflammation.", "pred": "The benefits of MSM powder include increased energy levels, enhanced skin health, and promotion of joint health.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "Answer: The benefits of MSM powder include increased energy levels, enhanced skin health, and promotion of joint health.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nThe question asks about the benefits of MSM powder. To answer this, I need to identify specific benefits mentioned in the given passages related to MSM powder.\nI have identified that the passages mention several benefits of MSM powder, including its ability to increase energy levels, enhance skin health, and promote joint health.\nBased on the identified benefits, I will now list them in a comprehensive and clear manner to answer the question.\n\nAnswer: The benefits of MSM powder include increased energy levels, enhanced skin health, and promotion of joint health.", "time_sec": 49.899, "generation_time_seconds": 34.5864, "selection_time_seconds": 15.3121, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"phase": "rollout", "beam": 0, "token_ids": [2082, 55856, 279, 3897, 46769, 311, 10542, 894, 3151, 1995, 911, 279, 7567, 315, 67491, 16723, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-3.5622, -0.0, -0.0138, -2.2578, -0.0399, -0.5337, -0.0453, -1.347, -0.4901, -0.8133, -0.2778, -0.0026, -0.0004, -0.0002, -