{"id": "425", "question": "what is a upc description", "gt": "Based on the provided passages, an UPDescription is:\n\n1. A barcode symbology used for tracking trade items in stores, consisting of 12 numeric digits that are uniquely assigned to each trade item. (Passage 1)\n2. A process involving receiving a specimen bottle from a member, ensuring it contains a minimum of 30 milliliters of urine, initialing the label in the member's presence, and verifying the information on the label and DD Form 2624 (a military form). (Passage 2)\n3. A barcode partner that provides GS1 Originated UPC and EAN codes, as well as a toll-free number and positive customer reviews. (Passage 3)\n\nUnable to answer based on given passages.", "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nIdentify the relevant information regarding \"UPC description\" in the given passages.\nSince the question asks for a description of what a \"UPC description\" is, we should look for any information related to the concept in the given passages.\nExamine the passages for any mention of \"UPC,\" \"description,\" or related terms that could provide insight into what a \"UPC description\" might be. Look for any definitions, examples, or explanations that could help define or clarify what the question is asking.\n\nUnable to answer based on given passages.", "time_sec": 45.824, "generation_time_seconds": 27.1742, "selection_time_seconds": 18.6497, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"phase": "rollout", "beam": 0, "token_ids": [5847, 19819, 32711, 3019, 25, 3984, 4324, 349, 389, 1128, 264, 95129, 374, 323, 1246, 432, 374, 1483, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-6.8972, -0.1019, -0.047, -0.0001, -0.0097, -5.9659, -0.0001, -0.0002, -0.0075, -0.6235, -0.132, -0.1045, -1.6345, -0.2619, -1.2776, -0.0138, -0.5361, -0.1314, 