{"id": "501", "question": "factors that cause oily skin", "gt": "Based on the given passages, the factors that cause oily skin are primarily genetic/hereditary factors and hormonal shifts in the body. Diet and poor hygiene/topical applications have a limited effect on the oiliness of the skin. Combination skin, which is a mix of oily and dry/normal areas, can also contribute to oily skin in certain areas such as the T-zone.", "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nIdentify the specific factors mentioned in the passages that contribute to oily skin.\nAnalyze the causes of oily skin from the passages.\nFind the specific examples, numbers, or comparisons that support the factors mentioned in the passages.\n\nUnable to answer based on given passages.", "time_sec": 32.429, "generation_time_seconds": 22.2574, "selection_time_seconds": 10.1714, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"phase": "rollout", "beam": 0, "token_ids": [28301, 1437, 279, 3151, 9363, 9733, 304, 279, 21085, 429, 16792, 311, 77471, 6787, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-0.7612, -0.0033, -0.1485, -0.5879, -0.12, -0.122, -0.0051, -0.0, -1.2258, -0.0145, -0.1718, -0.0, -0.0008, -0.0, -0.0328, -0.0911], "cumulative_logprob": -3.2848, "norm_logp": -0.2053, "input_len": 137, "output_tokens": 16}, {"phase": "rollout", "beam": 0, "token_ids": [37175, 279, 3151, 9363, 9733, 304, 279, 2661, 46769, 429, 646, 16792, 311, 77471, 6787, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-5.7612, -0.0657, -2.3923, -1.3987, -0.1798, -0.0119, -0.0001, -2.2481, -0.1165, -0.0951, -3.3726, -1.4035, -0.0, -0.0012, -0.0, -0.1259, -0.2937], "cumulative_logprob": -17.4663, "norm_logp": -1.0274, "input_len": 137, "output_tokens": 17}, {"phase": "rollout", "beam": 0, "token_ids": [28301, 1437, 279, 3151, 9363, 9733, 304, 279, 46769, 429, 16792, 311, 7