{"id": "574", "question": "how to quickly get rid of mice", "gt": "To quickly get rid of mice, it is important to take immediate action as they can quickly infest your home. One effective method is to seal off any entry points that mice can use to enter your house, such as pipes and vents. Placing steel wool inside these openings before sealing them can prevent mice from reentering. Additionally, eliminating any potential food sources and shelter can help deter mice from your home.", "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nExamine the provided passages for any specific methods or methods that are suggested for getting rid of mice quickly.\nExtract the specific methods mentioned in the passages for getting rid of mice quickly and determine which ones are described as quick.\nLook for any specific recommendations or techniques that are mentioned in the passages for quickly eliminating mice.\n\nUnable to answer based on given passages.", "time_sec": 53.596, "generation_time_seconds": 24.5925, "selection_time_seconds": 29.0034, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"phase": "rollout", "beam": 0, "token_ids": [840, 19991, 279, 4494, 315, 44560, 9733, 304, 279, 21085, 323, 10542, 892, 6174, 525, 3881, 369, 862, 26279, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-1.9269, -0.0057, -0.036, -3.8971, -0.0023, -0.1715, -0.2708, -0.0327, -0.0002, -0.969, -1.0168, -2.3424, -0.3979, -0.1696, -0.0928, -1.7118, -0.3433, -0.3255, -0.3969, -1.4503, -0.0294], "cumulative_logprob": -15.5889, "norm_logp": -0.7423, "input_len": 139, "output_tokens": 21}, {"phase": "rollout", "beam": 0, "token_ids": [10380, 369, 2797, 11221, 389, 1128, 5413, 525, 9733, 304, 279, 21085, 429, 646, 387, 1483, 311, 6157, 633, 9279, 315, 23627, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-2.9091, -0.011, -6.081, -1.577, -3.4648, -3.595, -