{"id": "656", "question": "how to properly clean your hair", "gt": "Based on the given passages, here are the steps to properly clean your hair:\n\n1. Rinse your hair completely with water.\n2. Use a wide-tooth comb to remove tangles and smooth the hair.\n3. Apply a conditioner and allow it to remain on for a few minutes.\n4. Rinse the hair with cool water and comb through it again.\n5. Dry the hair with a towel using a patting or stroking motion, avoiding rubbing the hair back and forth or in circles.\n\nAdditionally, it is recommended to use a hair dryer to completely dry your hair after washing, and to be gentle when handling wet hair to prevent damage.", "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nIdentify the specific cleaning methods discussed in the passages.\nIdentify the specific cleaning methods discussed in the passages.\nIdentify the specific cleaning methods discussed in the passages.\n\nUnable to answer based on given passages.", "time_sec": 33.97, "generation_time_seconds": 21.7758, "selection_time_seconds": 12.1938, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"phase": "rollout", "beam": 0, "token_ids": [785, 1156, 3019, 304, 10277, 15826, 697, 6869, 374, 311, 14401, 432, 26364, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-2.1575, -4.0757, -0.1402, -0.9022, -0.3856, -0.0001, -0.0048, -0.0, -0.2786, -0.0143, -0.9723, -0.3113, -0.1602, -0.6693, -0.6394], "cumulative_logprob": -10.7115, "norm_logp": -0.7141, "input_len": 138, "output_tokens": 15}, {"phase": "rollout", "beam": 0, "token_ids": [840, 19991, 279, 3151, 15826, 5413, 9733, 304, 279, 46769, 11, 2670, 11639, 11, 4494, 315, 3871, 11, 323, 3766, 12538, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-1.8896, -0.0197, -0.0085, -1.9043, -1.2204, -0.1639, -0.6954, -0.0124, -0.0004, -0.5426, -2.0159, -1.5893, -1.102, -0.2011, -2.0396, -0.0, -