{"id": "706", "question": "what do the colors of the tennessee flag mean", "gt": "The colors on the Tennessee Flag have significant meanings. The white color symbolizes purity, the blue color stands for the patriotism of the people of Tennessee, and the red color represents the readiness of the people to shed blood during warfare. The three white stars within the blue circle symbolize the three disparate forms of land that divide the state.", "pred": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "group_key": "ragtruth", "sub_category": "ragtruth", "dataset": "ragtruth", "method": "base_tot", "raw_output": "Unable to answer based on given passages.", "cot": "The reasoning steps are:\n\nExamine the specific colors used in the Tennessee flag and their historical or symbolic significance.\nIdentify and describe the colors present in the Tennessee flag and any known historical or symbolic meanings associated with those colors.\nLook for any direct statements or explanations in the passage about the colors and their meanings. If there are no explicit explanations, analyze the symbolism or historical context of the colors to infer their meanings.\n\nUnable to answer based on given passages.", "time_sec": 49.563, "generation_time_seconds": 25.8844, "selection_time_seconds": 23.6785, "record_process": true, "trajectories": [{"phase": "rollout", "beam": 0, "token_ids": [840, 19991, 279, 3151, 7987, 1483, 304, 279, 23219, 5181, 323, 862, 13656, 476, 35296, 25361, 13, 151645], "logp_list": [-1.4452, -0.0096, -0.0086, -1.5115, -0.3407, -1.8355, -0.5316, -0.0005, -0.0007, -0.0234, -0.1037, -0.235, -0.7501, -0.2966, -0.0802, -0.4869, -0.3438, -0.1174], "cumulative_logprob": -8.121, "norm_logp": -0.4512, "input_len": 142, "output_tokens": 18}, {"phase": "rollout", "beam": 0, "token_ids": [785, 3897, 3405, 17064, 11689, 911, 279, 7290, 315, 279, 7987, 389, 279, 23219, 5181, 13, 4354, 11, 279, 2661, 21085, 1172, 33845, 279, 9362, 315, 279, 23219, 5181, 2041, 24392, 1181, 7987, 476, 86